# Search-tool ignore file (ripgrep, fd, ag, and the agent search tools built on them).
# Hides large generated or binary files from code search. They are still in git and
# can still be opened directly by path.
**/package-lock.json
webview/visual/__snapshots__/
.claude/
build/
**/build/
/*/bin/
dist/
**/dist/
**/dist-test/
**/node_modules/
.gradle/
.intellijPlatform/
.kotlin/
*.vsix
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/.stryker-tmp/
webview/test-results/
vscode-extension/webview-dist/
vscode-extension/sidecar/

